CBRP Research Artifact - component licensing

This source distribution contains separately licensed components. It is not
licensed as a whole under MIT, BSD, or GPL. LICENSE-STATUS.md defines the exact
file scopes and the license of the assembled Flashproofs benchmark program.

* Flashproofs benchmark program as assembled here: GNU GPL version 3.
  Project-specific FlashproofRangeBench.java and FPSelfTest.java are offered
  under GPL-3.0-only. Upstream notices and component permissions are retained.
* Project-specific HashWires benchmark/test integration, Bulletproofs driver,
  selected tests, shared benchmark utilities, build/run scripts, and listed
  configuration/instructions: BSD-2-Clause, for the project-authored portions
  specified in LICENSE-STATUS.md.
* HashWires Java protocol port and third-party BulletProofLib: their applicable
  MIT licenses and notices.
* CBRP-DL and KTX research implementations, their research-specific tests,
  and reference material: no additional license grant is selected in this update.

Full texts are provided in LICENSES/GPL-3.txt,
LICENSES/BSD-2-Clause.txt, third_party/hashwires/LICENSE, third_party/bulletprooflib/LICENSE, and
third_party/flashproofs/License. The GPL text is also provided at the filename
referenced by the upstream notice: third_party/flashproofs/LICENSE-GPL.txt.

The reservation for unlicensed research material does not apply to the
explicitly GPL-, BSD-, or MIT-licensed components, does not restrict their
recipients' rights, and does not override rights available under applicable law.
Third-party copyright notices and licenses remain with their respective works.
